        "original_id": "fedfb34d-c111-536e-b10f-f5eac36fe6ab",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, Matt Groening, Rich Moore, Hank Azaria, James L. Brooks\n- Works: \"The Telltale Head\"\n- Characters: Apu Nahasapeemapetilon, Homer Simpson\n- Roles: writers, director, voice actor, creator, designer\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Groening was born on February 15, 1954.\n- Matt Groening is an American cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, and voice actor.\n- \"The Telltale Head\" was written by Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, and Matt Groening.\n- \"The Telltale Head\" was directed by Rich Moore.\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon first appeared in the episode \"The Telltale Head\".\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon is voiced by Hank Azaria.\n- Homer Simpson was created and designed by Matt Groening.\n- Matt Groening created and designed Homer Simpson while waiting in the lobby of James L. Brooks' office.",
